{"id": "1533387008435552407", "channel_id": "1533387008435552407", "author_id": "256852230685196288", "author_name": "shrike784", "content": "1. Adding posse name in selection window\nin Triad posse, groups contaning 2 or 3 posses with selection can be the cause of faulty command.\nIt's not problem of \"remember 3 posses\", players can be leave from screen for any reason, and that time can be long too. adding name of posse on selection window will be help in this case.\nImagine a man leave a selection window then drive an hour for pickup his family for answering call... yes, that wasn't big problem but wasn't good experience.\n\n2. Adding indicator of GLotan rouse\nRouse provide Final DMG increase to +90/135% by each stolen ailemus but there is no indicator how increased it same as Arachne's Verdict number. did I miss it?\nIt's maximizing has high risk needs 4 turns because starting point of rouse effect is \"next turn\" of Whalefall forged and it may not be maximized even after 4 turns. Adding indicator helps assess it's worth or not to players.\n\n3. Adding cut-in for Primordial Memory\nThere is no cut-in so when I choose a group include Primordial Memory I don't feel like it's not 3 posses.\nMaybe it just mood issue, but motivation of playing game is mood.\nif it hard to add cut-in with \"Primordial Memory\" name, making a new posse same name that provide n/8 random option can be a way I think.\n\none more, the backgrounds whale has pattern on body in GLotan's live2d and this pattern split from body. it's quiet annoying...", "timestamp": "2026-08-02T08:12:31.764000+00:00", "thread_id": "1533387008435552407", "edited_timestamp": "2026-08-02T08:21:51.632000+00:00", "reactions": [{"emoji": "Celeste_agree", "emoji_id": "1400771815076528258", "count": 1}], "attachments": [{"id": "1533389279894573066", "filename": "image.png", "content_type": "image/webp", "size": 85802, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1533387008435552407/1533389279894573066/image.png?ex=6a704f8d&is=6a6efe0d&hm=a53fe1b7787281913eadc85e40bea77e538cefe0f6152eb089f54c2722a6ed89&"}, {"id": "1533389280502878238", "filename": "image.png", "content_type": "image/webp", "size": 139526, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1533387008435552407/1533389280502878238/image.png?ex=6a704f8d&is=6a6efe0d&hm=852cf0901edeed81b45f811060e19af4fcbd52c9ee4b98e3619c48fe705c3779&"}], "thread_title": "UI improvement of PChaos/GLotan", "forum_channel_id": "1180845276823564288", "thread_tags": ["1181168158678204497", "1361168939622727801"], "is_thread_starter": true}
